CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: Senate President

asr-000986
01:24:08.940 --> 01:24:10.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: Win Gatchalian, and

asr-000987
01:24:10.940 --> 01:24:12.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: Sen. Ping Lacson.

asr-000988
01:24:12.940 --> 01:24:14.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: We at Code NGO, with our 11

asr-000989
01:24:14.940 --> 01:24:16.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: regional networks, we represent

asr-000990
01:24:16.940 --> 01:24:18.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: 2,000 plus NGOs,

asr-000991
01:24:18.940 --> 01:24:20.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: people's organizations, and

asr-000992
01:24:20.940 --> 01:24:22.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: cooperatives. And we call for

asr-000993
01:24:22.940 --> 01:24:24.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: a 2027 budget that

asr-000994
01:24:24.940 --> 01:24:26.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: reach communities and protect rights.

asr-000995
01:24:26.940 --> 01:24:28.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: So we raise our concern, our issues

asr-000996
01:24:28.940 --> 01:24:30.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: and concern first.

asr-000997
01:24:30.940 --> 01:24:32.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: We call our

asr-000998
01:24:32.940 --> 01:24:34.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: attention to a higher

asr-000999
01:24:34.940 --> 01:24:36.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: budget for discretionary

asr-001000
01:24:36.940 --> 01:24:38.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: funds. So

asr-001001
01:24:38.940 --> 01:24:40.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: the

asr-001002
01:24:40.940 --> 01:24:42.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: there is a significant

asr-001003
01:24:42.940 --> 01:24:44.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: increase in the discretionary funds

asr-001004
01:24:44.940 --> 01:24:46.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: such as the Local Government Support Fund

asr-001005
01:24:46.940 --> 01:24:48.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: and the Support to Barangay Development

asr-001006
01:24:48.940 --> 01:24:50.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: Program. And we call

asr-001007
01:24:50.940 --> 01:24:52.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: for the Congress to assess these allocations

asr-001008
01:24:52.940 --> 01:24:54.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: against unmet needs in health,

asr-001009
01:24:54.940 --> 01:24:56.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: education, livelihood, disaster

asr-001010
01:24:56.940 --> 01:24:58.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: resilience, and social protection.

asr-001011
01:24:58.940 --> 01:25:00.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: And explain how the proposed

asr-001012
01:25:00.940 --> 01:25:02.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: spending addresses these priorities

asr-001013
01:25:02.940 --> 01:25:04.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: despite the already many

asr-001014
01:25:04.940 --> 01:25:06.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: budget lines addressing these needs.

asr-001015
01:25:06.940 --> 01:25:08.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: And we also want to

asr-001016
01:25:08.940 --> 01:25:10.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: zone in on the proposed

asr-001017
01:25:10.940 --> 01:25:12.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: confidential and intelligence fund

asr-001018
01:25:12.940 --> 01:25:14.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: of the Office of the President. We

asr-001019
01:25:14.940 --> 01:25:16.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: recognize that the

asr-001020
01:25:16.940 --> 01:25:18.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: impeachment proceeding already

asr-001021
01:25:18.940 --> 01:25:20.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: opened the door on discussions

asr-001022
01:25:20.940 --> 01:25:22.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: on confidential and intelligence

asr-001023
01:25:22.940 --> 01:25:24.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: funds, and we need to continue this

asr-001024
01:25:24.940 --> 01:25:26.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: conversation. We need to

asr-001025
01:25:26.940 --> 01:25:28.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: examine the necessity, scale,

asr-001026
01:25:28.940 --> 01:25:30.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: and justification, and require

asr-001027
01:25:30.940 --> 01:25:32.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: the appropriate safeguards and accountability

asr-001028
01:25:32.940 --> 01:25:34.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: for these confidential funds.

asr-001029
01:25:34.940 --> 01:25:36.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: The allocations supporting

asr-001030
01:25:36.940 --> 01:25:38.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: the NTF-ELCAC

asr-001031
01:25:38.940 --> 01:25:40.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: activities across agencies

asr-001032
01:25:40.940 --> 01:25:42.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: must be

asr-001033
01:25:42.940 --> 01:25:44.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: clearly identified and screwed in

asr-001034
01:25:44.940 --> 01:25:46.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: for their purposes, results,

asr-001035
01:25:46.940 --> 01:25:48.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: and human rights implications.

asr-001036
