CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: We've heard firsthand

asr-001037
01:25:50.940 --> 01:25:52.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: on how the NTF-ELCAC

asr-001038
01:25:52.940 --> 01:25:54.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: plays a leading role in

asr-001039
01:25:54.940 --> 01:25:56.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: the proliferation

asr-001040
01:25:56.940 --> 01:25:58.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: of red-tagging that our Supreme Court

asr-001041
01:25:58.940 --> 01:26:00.940
CODE-NGO Representative Catherine Basalote: has already established as a

asr-001042
