asr-001223
01:35:10.220 --> 01:35:12.080
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: our sincerest appreciation

asr-001224
01:35:12.080 --> 01:35:13.840
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: to the Senate, particularly

asr-001225
01:35:13.840 --> 01:35:15.520
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: Senate President William Gatchalian

asr-001226
01:35:15.520 --> 01:35:18.000
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: and to the committee led by

asr-001227
01:35:18.000 --> 01:35:19.300
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: Senator J.B. Ejercito

asr-001228
01:35:19.300 --> 01:35:20.740
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: for this

asr-001229
01:35:20.740 --> 01:35:23.180
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: for providing civil society organizations

asr-001230
01:35:23.180 --> 01:35:25.540
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: the opportunity to participate

asr-001231
01:35:25.540 --> 01:35:27.720
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: in the national budget deliberations.

asr-001232
01:35:28.420 --> 01:35:30.900
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: This is a very important step

asr-001233
01:35:30.900 --> 01:35:33.960
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: towards strengthening participatory governance

asr-001234
01:35:33.960 --> 01:35:35.880
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: and advancing transparency

asr-001235
01:35:35.880 --> 01:35:37.180
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: and accountability

asr-001236
01:35:37.180 --> 01:35:39.120
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: in the budget process.

asr-001237
01:35:39.760 --> 01:35:41.720
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: We hope that this practice

asr-001238
01:35:41.720 --> 01:35:44.380
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: will continue and further institutionalize

asr-001239
01:35:44.380 --> 01:35:45.800
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: the role of civil society

asr-001240
01:35:45.800 --> 01:35:47.960
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: in shaping public policy

asr-001241
01:35:47.960 --> 01:35:50.040
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: and promoting a more open,

asr-001242
01:35:50.740 --> 01:35:52.540
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: inclusive, transparent,

asr-001243
01:35:52.920 --> 01:35:54.440
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: and accountable governance.

asr-001244
01:35:55.440 --> 01:35:56.860
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: We thank also,

asr-001245
01:35:57.060 --> 01:35:58.320
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: as mentioned by the chair,

asr-001246
01:35:58.580 --> 01:36:00.560
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: so Democracy Watch would want to support

asr-001247
01:36:00.560 --> 01:36:02.840
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: and give our full appreciation

asr-001248
01:36:02.840 --> 01:36:05.560
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: to the bills pending

asr-001249
01:36:05.560 --> 01:36:07.000
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: in the committee.

asr-001250
01:36:08.000 --> 01:36:09.020
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: And we hope

asr-001251
01:36:09.020 --> 01:36:10.640
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: and thank the committee

asr-001252
01:36:10.640 --> 01:36:12.080
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: for recognizing the value

asr-001253
01:36:12.080 --> 01:36:13.380
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: of civil society participation

asr-001254
01:36:13.380 --> 01:36:14.880
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: in this important process.

asr-001255
01:36:15.180 --> 01:36:15.560
Democracy Watch Convener Lloyd Ian C. Zaragoza: Thank you.

asr-001256
01:36:16.380 --> 01:36:17.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you.

asr-001257
01:36:18.260 --> 01:36:19.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sir Lloyd Zaragoza next.

asr-001258
01:36:20.080 --> 01:36:20.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: He's off.

asr-001259
01:36:20.740 --> 01:36:24.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: FOI Youth Initiative or FYI.

asr-001260
01:36:24.520 --> 01:36:26.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. Aljon Patrick Acupan.

asr-001261
01:36:27.140 --> 01:36:28.420
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: Thank you, Mr. Chair,

asr-001262
01:36:28.640 --> 01:36:29.980
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: and good afternoon to everyone.

asr-001263
01:36:30.520 --> 01:36:32.500
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: First, we want to thank the Senate

asr-001264
01:36:32.500 --> 01:36:35.040
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: for recognizing the role of the CSOs

asr-001265
01:36:35.040 --> 01:36:36.380
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: and for acknowledging the role

asr-001266
01:36:36.380 --> 01:36:37.780
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: that we play in nation building.

asr-001267
01:36:38.320 --> 01:36:39.820
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: And I want to start by saying

asr-001268
01:36:39.820 --> 01:36:41.000
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: that the cost of learning

asr-001269
01:36:41.000 --> 01:36:42.400
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: for civil society government,

asr-001270
01:36:42.720 --> 01:36:43.640
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: civil society organizations,

asr-001271
01:36:43.820 --> 01:36:44.780
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: and the government alike

asr-001272
01:36:44.780 --> 01:36:46.800
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: when it comes to protecting the budget

asr-001273
01:36:46.800 --> 01:36:48.340
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: is already so high.

asr-001274
01:36:48.660 --> 01:36:50.240
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: And we are at this point, actually,

asr-001275
01:36:50.240 --> 01:36:50.720
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: that we are not able to do so.

asr-001276
01:36:50.720 --> 01:36:52.080
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: We are now, should be talking about

asr-001277
01:36:52.080 --> 01:36:53.160
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: how we could prevent that

asr-001278
01:36:53.160 --> 01:36:54.060
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: from happening further.

asr-001279
01:36:54.620 --> 01:36:56.240
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: So my organization is really about

asr-001280
01:36:56.240 --> 01:36:58.440
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: the campaigning for the right to information.

asr-001281
01:36:58.680 --> 01:36:59.760
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: And we already thank the Senate

asr-001282
01:36:59.760 --> 01:37:02.260
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: for doing its job in passing

asr-001283
01:37:02.260 --> 01:37:03.680
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: the right to information bill

asr-001284
01:37:03.680 --> 01:37:05.160
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: that has been waiting for action

asr-001285
01:37:05.160 --> 01:37:06.880
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: for almost three decades now.

asr-001286
01:37:07.300 --> 01:37:08.740
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: And we are looking forward

asr-001287
01:37:08.740 --> 01:37:09.680
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: to the time that

asr-001288
01:37:09.680 --> 01:37:12.260
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: the Bicameral Conference Committee

asr-001289
01:37:12.260 --> 01:37:14.520
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: would convene to finally pass it to a law.

asr-001290
01:37:14.900 --> 01:37:16.520
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: Now we are here to support

asr-001291
01:37:16.520 --> 01:37:18.420
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: the demand for transparency

asr-001292
01:37:18.420 --> 01:37:19.400
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: in the budget process.

asr-001293
01:37:19.600 --> 01:37:20.680
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: The Chair has recognized

asr-001294
01:37:20.720 --> 01:37:22.140
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: and rightly raised the need

asr-001295
01:37:22.140 --> 01:37:24.080
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: to restore public trust in government

asr-001296
01:37:24.080 --> 01:37:25.400
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: and in the budget process.

asr-001297
01:37:25.880 --> 01:37:27.520
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: I believe we must recognize

asr-001298
01:37:27.520 --> 01:37:28.880
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: the trust is not restored

asr-001299
01:37:28.880 --> 01:37:30.520
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: simply by hoping that

asr-001300
01:37:30.520 --> 01:37:33.160
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: the public should trust our institutions.

asr-001301
01:37:33.400 --> 01:37:33.980
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: It is restored

asr-001302
01:37:33.980 --> 01:37:35.940
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: when citizens feel that

asr-001303
01:37:35.940 --> 01:37:37.420
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: our reforms deliver.

asr-001304
01:37:37.900 --> 01:37:39.980
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: We can start by making citizens

asr-001305
01:37:39.980 --> 01:37:42.260
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: independently examine government decisions,

asr-001306
01:37:43.100 --> 01:37:44.740
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: understand how public money

asr-001307
01:37:44.740 --> 01:37:46.380
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: is allocated and spent,

asr-001308
01:37:46.700 --> 01:37:48.540
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: and see whether these decisions

asr-001309
01:37:48.540 --> 01:37:49.920
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: respond to their needs.

asr-001310
01:37:50.720 --> 01:37:52.620
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: This is where access to information

asr-001311
01:37:52.620 --> 01:37:54.100
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: becomes indispensable.

asr-001312
01:37:54.400 --> 01:37:56.440
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: Specifically on the budget process,

asr-001313
01:37:56.680 --> 01:37:58.940
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: it matters not only when information

asr-001314
01:37:58.940 --> 01:37:59.840
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: is not disclosed.

asr-001315
01:38:00.220 --> 01:38:01.100
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: As an advocate,

asr-001316
01:38:01.100 --> 01:38:04.500
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: it matters when transparency is absent

asr-001317
01:38:04.500 --> 01:38:07.060
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: or when we lack transparency,

asr-001318
01:38:07.320 --> 01:38:09.480
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: or when information is not released

asr-001319
01:38:09.480 --> 01:38:10.280
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: or on time,

asr-001320
01:38:10.560 --> 01:38:12.500
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: or if it is not presented in a way

asr-001321
01:38:12.580 --> 01:38:14.440
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: that our citizens could understand.

asr-001322
01:38:15.400 --> 01:38:17.260
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: This makes participation difficult

asr-001323
01:38:17.260 --> 01:38:19.720
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: for citizens and weakens public scrutiny.

asr-001324
01:38:20.060 --> 01:38:20.640
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: Worse,

asr-001325
01:38:20.820 --> 01:38:22.320
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: even when people are invited

asr-001326
01:38:22.320 --> 01:38:23.380
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: in consultations,

asr-001327
01:38:23.640 --> 01:38:26.100
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: they may have little to no basis

asr-001328
01:38:26.100 --> 01:38:28.120
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: to assess whether these contributions

asr-001329
01:38:28.120 --> 01:38:29.040
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: actually matter.

asr-001330
01:38:29.580 --> 01:38:31.540
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: With existing efforts in place,

asr-001331
01:38:31.540 --> 01:38:32.960
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: we encourage the Senate

asr-001332
01:38:32.960 --> 01:38:34.620
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: to lead further reforms

asr-001333
01:38:34.620 --> 01:38:37.000
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: that are rooted in increasing transparency,

asr-001334
01:38:37.640 --> 01:38:39.340
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: traceability, and citizen oversight

asr-001335
01:38:39.340 --> 01:38:41.080
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: to prevent backroom attempts

asr-001336
01:38:41.080 --> 01:38:42.660
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: to game the budget process.

asr-001337
01:38:43.240 --> 01:38:45.000
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: And I will now

asr-001338
01:38:45.000 --> 01:38:46.820
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: critique on some of the

asr-001339
01:38:46.820 --> 01:38:48.520
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: transparency initiatives

asr-001340
01:38:48.520 --> 01:38:50.500
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: that I believe should be strengthened.

asr-001341
01:38:50.720 --> 01:38:53.620
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: First, on live streaming the budget hearings.

asr-001342
01:38:54.040 --> 01:38:56.440
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: We acknowledge that this is a very important step

asr-001343
01:38:56.440 --> 01:38:58.200
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: that the people could follow

asr-001344
01:38:58.200 --> 01:39:01.360
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: on their mobile phones

asr-001345
01:39:01.360 --> 01:39:02.860
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: what is happening on the floor.

asr-001346
01:39:03.280 --> 01:39:05.100
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: But without access to records

asr-001347
01:39:05.100 --> 01:39:06.600
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: and what are the assumptions

asr-001348
01:39:06.600 --> 01:39:08.320
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: that came with this budget proposal,

asr-001349
01:39:08.600 --> 01:39:09.860
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: it makes participation

asr-001350
01:39:09.860 --> 01:39:12.940
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: a piecemeal attempt for the CSOs.

asr-001351
01:39:13.860 --> 01:39:14.940
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: And what is the value

asr-001352
01:39:14.940 --> 01:39:16.380
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: of live streaming deliberations

asr-001353
01:39:16.380 --> 01:39:18.160
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: if the substantive negotiations

asr-001354
01:39:18.160 --> 01:39:19.600
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: have already taken place

asr-001355
01:39:19.600 --> 01:39:20.680
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: in closed-term meetings?

asr-001356
01:39:20.720 --> 01:39:22.500
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: And what does transparency mean

asr-001357
01:39:22.500 --> 01:39:23.800
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: if citizens can watch

asr-001358
01:39:23.800 --> 01:39:26.020
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: the proceedings but cannot access

asr-001359
01:39:26.020 --> 01:39:27.700
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: the underlying documents

asr-001360
01:39:27.700 --> 01:39:28.760
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: and proposed amendments

asr-001361
01:39:28.760 --> 01:39:31.360
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: and compare the different versions at ease?

asr-001362
01:39:31.880 --> 01:39:33.200
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: Second, on abolishing

asr-001363
01:39:33.200 --> 01:39:34.860
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: closed-door small committee.

asr-001364
01:39:35.600 --> 01:39:37.240
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: Does abolishing a particular committee

asr-001365
01:39:37.240 --> 01:39:38.260
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: eliminate opacity

asr-001366
01:39:38.260 --> 01:39:39.700
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: if similar negotiations

asr-001367
01:39:39.700 --> 01:39:41.840
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: simply migrate to other informal

asr-001368
01:39:41.840 --> 01:39:43.860
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: or undocumented settings?

asr-001369
01:39:44.280 --> 01:39:45.720
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: This is the kind of assurance

asr-001370
01:39:45.720 --> 01:39:47.400
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: that our people deserve,

asr-001371
01:39:47.400 --> 01:39:50.400
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: that everything is done transparently

asr-001372
01:39:50.720 --> 01:39:53.400
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: over all these reforms

asr-001373
01:39:53.400 --> 01:39:54.920
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: may be important steps,

asr-001374
01:39:55.100 --> 01:39:56.360
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: but we must not confuse

asr-001375
01:39:56.360 --> 01:39:58.580
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: the existence of transparency mechanism

asr-001376
01:39:58.580 --> 01:40:00.740
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: with the achievement of transparency.

asr-001377
01:40:01.400 --> 01:40:03.100
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: Information must be available

asr-001378
01:40:03.100 --> 01:40:06.240
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: before, during, and after decisions.

asr-001379
01:40:06.760 --> 01:40:08.920
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: This also follows the budget process.

asr-001380
01:40:09.420 --> 01:40:11.040
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: Records must allow the public

asr-001381
01:40:11.040 --> 01:40:12.800
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: to reconstruct and scrutinize

asr-001382
01:40:12.800 --> 01:40:14.020
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: those documents.

asr-001383
01:40:14.600 --> 01:40:16.780
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: And disclosures must establish

asr-001384
01:40:16.780 --> 01:40:18.300
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: not only what was spent,

asr-001385
01:40:18.760 --> 01:40:19.760
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: but who decided

asr-001386
01:40:19.760 --> 01:40:20.600
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: and on what basis.

asr-001387
01:40:20.600 --> 01:40:22.700
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: And with what results.

asr-001388
01:40:23.400 --> 01:40:24.300
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: We turn our attention

asr-001389
01:40:24.300 --> 01:40:25.640
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: to how an effective

asr-001390
01:40:25.640 --> 01:40:27.140
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: and inclusive budget process

asr-001391
01:40:27.140 --> 01:40:28.740
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: could deliver felt outcomes

asr-001392
01:40:28.740 --> 01:40:29.500
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: for the people.

asr-001393
01:40:30.120 --> 01:40:32.080
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: Make the budget outcome-based.

asr-001394
01:40:32.440 --> 01:40:33.840
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: We must be able to determine

asr-001395
01:40:33.840 --> 01:40:35.080
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: whether public spending

asr-001396
01:40:35.080 --> 01:40:36.620
FOI Youth Initiative Co-convenor Aljon Patrick Acupan: improved learning outcomes,

