asr-002605
02:13:56.260 --> 02:13:57.180
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: At yung statement po

asr-002606
02:13:57.180 --> 02:13:58.080
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: na babasahin ko po

asr-002607
02:13:58.080 --> 02:13:59.620
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: ay pinilimahan po

asr-002608
02:13:59.620 --> 02:14:01.480
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: ng aming mga miyembro.

asr-002609
02:14:02.200 --> 02:14:02.420
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: So,

asr-002610
02:14:02.700 --> 02:14:04.820
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: the members of HPAC

asr-002611
02:14:04.820 --> 02:14:06.960
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: respectfully express

asr-002612
02:14:06.960 --> 02:14:07.860
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: our deep concern

asr-002613
02:14:07.860 --> 02:14:08.740
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: over the proposed

asr-002614
02:14:08.740 --> 02:14:10.120
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: 2027

asr-002615
02:14:10.920 --> 02:14:12.520
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: General Appropriations Bill.

asr-002616
02:14:12.920 --> 02:14:14.020
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We strongly oppose

asr-002617
02:14:14.020 --> 02:14:18.440
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: two specific provisions,

asr-002618
02:14:18.440 --> 02:14:20.440
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: the proposed

asr-002619
02:14:22.120 --> 02:14:23.420
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: 74 billion PhilHealth allocation

asr-002620
02:14:23.420 --> 02:14:24.440
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: for 2027

asr-002621
02:14:24.440 --> 02:14:26.040
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and the increase

asr-002622
02:14:26.040 --> 02:14:28.160
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: in the budget of my FIP.

asr-002623
02:14:28.780 --> 02:14:31.120
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: On the 74 billion PhilHealth allocation

asr-002624
02:14:31.120 --> 02:14:32.080
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: for 2027,

asr-002625
02:14:32.300 --> 02:14:33.880
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: we believe this is grossly inadequate

asr-002626
02:14:33.880 --> 02:14:35.920
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and will rapidly be exhausted.

asr-002627
02:14:36.920 --> 02:14:37.900
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: This amount is projected

asr-002628
02:14:37.900 --> 02:14:38.800
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: to sustain PhilHealth

asr-002629
02:14:38.800 --> 02:14:40.860
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: only until approximately

asr-002630
02:14:40.860 --> 02:14:42.500
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: March 2027

asr-002631
02:14:42.500 --> 02:14:43.600
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and after that,

asr-002632
02:14:43.680 --> 02:14:44.720
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: the burden of healthcare costs

asr-002633
02:14:44.720 --> 02:14:45.700
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: will increasingly fall

asr-002634
02:14:45.700 --> 02:14:47.100
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: on patients themselves,

asr-002635
02:14:47.560 --> 02:14:48.820
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: including direct contributors

asr-002636
02:14:48.820 --> 02:14:50.800
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: who already pay into the system

asr-002637
02:14:50.800 --> 02:14:51.920
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: but are not receiving

asr-002638
02:14:51.920 --> 02:14:52.900
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: benefits commensurate

asr-002639
02:14:52.900 --> 02:14:53.860
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: with their contributions.

asr-002640
02:14:54.780 --> 02:14:56.180
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: This is not an isolated

asr-002641
02:14:56.180 --> 02:14:57.320
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: budgetary shortfall.

asr-002642
02:14:58.200 --> 02:14:59.520
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: The chronic underfunding of

asr-002643
02:14:59.520 --> 02:15:01.400
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: PhilHealth represents a continuing failure

asr-002650
02:15:01.400 --> 02:15:06.800
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: to fulfill the government's obligations under the Universal Health Care Act.

asr-002651
02:15:06.800 --> 02:15:17.160
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Since 2022, approximately P311 billion in earmarked revenues from Syntaxes, PCSO, and Pagcor

asr-002652
02:15:17.160 --> 02:15:20.180
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: have been withheld or left unappropriated.

asr-002653
02:15:21.040 --> 02:15:27.680
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: These resources were intended to help finance the UHC reforms

asr-002654
02:15:27.680 --> 02:15:31.880
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and should not be diverted, withheld, or left idle

asr-002655
02:15:31.880 --> 02:15:36.560
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: when Filipinos continue to face catastrophic out-of-pocket health care costs.

asr-002656
02:15:37.720 --> 02:15:46.700
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: The second provision that we have deep concern is the increase in the allocation for the MAIFIP

asr-002657
02:15:46.700 --> 02:15:50.380
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: or the Medical Assistance for Indigent and Financially Incapacitated Patients

asr-002658
02:15:50.380 --> 02:15:54.620
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: from approximately P24 billion to nearly P50 billion.

asr-002659
02:15:55.420 --> 02:15:57.620
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We understand that while financial assistance

asr-002660
02:15:57.680 --> 02:16:00.580
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: to patients in need is essential,

asr-002661
02:16:00.580 --> 02:16:03.580
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: the current system is fundamentally inequitable.

asr-002662
02:16:05.220 --> 02:16:10.560
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We observe, our members see that tens of thousands of Filipinos

asr-002663
02:16:10.560 --> 02:16:13.700
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: are arbitrarily denied of MAIFIP benefits.

asr-002664
02:16:14.240 --> 02:16:18.260
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: They come to us asking for help, yet we are often powerless

asr-002665
02:16:18.260 --> 02:16:26.320
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: because of access to these funds depends on the discretion of our local officials.

asr-002666
02:16:27.680 --> 02:16:30.280
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Health care should not depend on whom a patient knows,

asr-002667
02:16:30.600 --> 02:16:33.540
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: whom they can approach, or whom they can persuade to help them.

asr-002668
02:16:34.340 --> 02:16:37.580
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: The amount of assistance a patient receives should be determined

asr-002669
02:16:37.580 --> 02:16:40.960
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: by the nature and severity of their illness and the health care they require,

asr-002670
02:16:41.300 --> 02:16:42.580
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: not by political connections.

asr-002671
02:16:43.140 --> 02:16:46.080
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: MAIFIP has consequently become vulnerable to use

asr-002672
02:16:46.080 --> 02:16:49.580
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: as a political instrument and a mechanism of patronage.

asr-002673
02:16:50.160 --> 02:16:53.420
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Like what other resource persons mentioned here,

asr-002674
02:16:53.420 --> 02:16:57.580
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: we advocate for the abolition of the discretionary,

asr-002675
02:16:57.680 --> 02:16:59.460
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: medical assistance funds such as MAIFIP

asr-002676
02:16:59.460 --> 02:17:02.660
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and the transfer of these resources to PhilHealth,

asr-002677
02:17:03.160 --> 02:17:05.120
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: where they can be administered through transparent,

asr-002678
02:17:05.720 --> 02:17:07.760
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: equitable, and rules-based mechanisms

asr-002679
02:17:07.760 --> 02:17:12.300
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: that ensures assistance is determined by health care needs

asr-002680
02:17:12.300 --> 02:17:15.420
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and ability to pay, not political connections.

asr-002681
02:17:16.200 --> 02:17:19.640
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: So ito po yung plea ng mga miyembro po ng HPAC.

asr-002682
02:17:20.300 --> 02:17:21.440
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Ito po yung apat na plea namin.

asr-002683
02:17:21.440 --> 02:17:25.300
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Una, immediate correction of the 2027 PhilHealth funding gap.

asr-002684
02:17:25.800 --> 02:17:27.440
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We urge the Congress and the...

asr-002685
02:17:27.680 --> 02:17:29.600
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: during the budget amendment process

asr-002686
02:17:29.600 --> 02:17:34.340
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: to decisively close the approximately 170 billion funding shortfall

asr-002687
02:17:34.340 --> 02:17:39.460
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and provide PhilHealth with at least the full 244 billion

asr-002688
02:17:39.460 --> 02:17:42.380
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: minimum subsidy requirement for 2027.

asr-002689
02:17:42.940 --> 02:17:46.560
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Second, full remittance and appropriation of PhilHealth funds.

asr-002690
02:17:47.200 --> 02:17:49.760
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We call for the immediate release and appropriation

asr-002691
02:17:49.760 --> 02:17:52.880
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: of the cumulative 311 billion in PhilHealth,

asr-002692
02:17:53.340 --> 02:17:57.660
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: unappropriated and unreleased syntax, pag-core, and PCS,

asr-002693
02:17:57.680 --> 02:18:00.620
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: or earmarks from 2022 to 2027

asr-002694
02:18:00.620 --> 02:18:02.860
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: for their intended health purposes,

asr-002695
02:18:03.440 --> 02:18:06.620
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: particularly to strengthen PhilHealth benefit packages

asr-002696
02:18:06.620 --> 02:18:09.280
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and reduce the burden of out-of-pocket spending.

asr-002697
02:18:10.300 --> 02:18:14.600
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Third, elimination of discretionary health patronage funds

asr-002698
02:18:14.600 --> 02:18:15.980
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: such as MAIFIP.

asr-002699
02:18:16.400 --> 02:18:19.860
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We call for the transfer of discretionary medical assistance funds,

asr-002700
02:18:20.220 --> 02:18:22.780
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: including MAIFIP, directly to PhilHealth

asr-002701
02:18:22.780 --> 02:18:27.180
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and their conversion into transparent, rules-based health benefits,

asr-002702
02:18:27.680 --> 02:18:29.780
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: including effective zero-distance billing

asr-002703
02:18:29.780 --> 02:18:32.760
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: for indigent and financially incapacitated patients.

asr-002704
02:18:33.480 --> 02:18:35.700
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: And lastly, transparency and accountability.

asr-002705
02:18:36.120 --> 02:18:38.500
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We demand full public disclosure and accountability

asr-002706
02:18:38.500 --> 02:18:43.220
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: for all executive releases and congressional budget actions

asr-002707
02:18:43.220 --> 02:18:45.440
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: affecting universal healthcare,

asr-002708
02:18:45.960 --> 02:18:49.920
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: including the allocation, withholding, release,

asr-002709
02:18:50.100 --> 02:18:52.920
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and utilization of funds intended for PhilHealth

asr-002710
02:18:52.920 --> 02:18:54.200
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and other UHC programs.

asr-002711
02:18:54.640 --> 02:18:57.640
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: So every day, on the front lines of our healthcare system,

asr-002712
02:18:57.680 --> 02:19:08.380
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: we witness the devastating human cost of these budget decisions.

asr-002713
02:19:08.900 --> 02:19:13.960
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: As healthcare workers, we see the families of our patients

asr-002714
02:19:13.960 --> 02:19:16.760
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: driven into deep poverty by catastrophic hospital bills.

asr-002715
02:19:17.220 --> 02:19:19.780
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We see patients delay or forego urgent treatment

asr-002716
02:19:19.780 --> 02:19:20.980
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: because they cannot afford it.

asr-002717
02:19:21.840 --> 02:19:25.820
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: We are forced to watch patients go without the funds

asr-002718
02:19:25.820 --> 02:19:27.560
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: they need to receive the life-saving care.

asr-002719
02:19:27.680 --> 02:19:29.940
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: And we see something that should never be acceptable

asr-002720
02:19:29.940 --> 02:19:31.260
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: in a democratic society.

asr-002721
02:19:31.900 --> 02:19:36.520
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Filipinos are forced to beg, line up at politicians' offices,

asr-002722
02:19:36.520 --> 02:19:39.260
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and seek personal favor simply to obtain healthcare

asr-002723
02:19:39.260 --> 02:19:40.680
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: that should be their right.

asr-002724
02:19:41.540 --> 02:19:44.680
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: So this is not UHC.

asr-002725
02:19:45.160 --> 02:19:47.080
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: Healthcare is the people's right.

asr-002726
02:19:47.200 --> 02:19:50.700
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: And I'm sure all of us have the same sentiment

asr-002727
02:19:50.700 --> 02:19:51.680
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and recommendations.

asr-002728
02:19:52.040 --> 02:19:54.900
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: It must never be reduced to a discretionary fund

asr-002729
02:19:54.900 --> 02:19:57.220
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: nor converted into currency.

asr-002730
02:19:57.680 --> 02:19:58.860
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: It must never be reduced to political patronage

asr-002731
02:19:58.860 --> 02:19:59.800
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: or self-interest.

asr-002732
02:20:00.480 --> 02:20:04.700
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: So kami po, ang mga miyembro po ng Healthcare Professional Alliance,

asr-002733
02:20:05.260 --> 02:20:06.660
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: after COVID-19,

asr-002734
02:20:07.240 --> 02:20:09.760
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: we call on Congress, the Executive,

asr-002735
02:20:09.940 --> 02:20:12.220
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: and all those interested with the people's resources

asr-002736
02:20:12.220 --> 02:20:15.780
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: to put patients and people, not politics,

asr-002737
02:20:16.120 --> 02:20:18.420
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: at the center of the 2027 National Budget.

asr-002738
02:20:18.680 --> 02:20:20.700
Healthcare Professional Alliance Representative Dr. Albert Ong: So marami pong salamat.

asr-002739
02:20:22.000 --> 02:20:24.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Dr. Albert Ong.

asr-002740
02:20:24.240 --> 02:20:27.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senator Laxon would like to make an interjection.

asr-002741
02:20:27.680 --> 02:20:28.980
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: I'm not sure it escapes my mind.

asr-002742
02:20:29.260 --> 02:20:30.160
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Singit na lang ako.

asr-002743
02:20:30.720 --> 02:20:33.980
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: I'm not sure kung na ng mga colleagues nyo yung

asr-002744
02:20:33.980 --> 02:20:38.280
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: ano ba yung total accumulated unreleased earmarks?

asr-002745
02:20:39.220 --> 02:20:41.540
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Yung nag-accumulate na over the years.

asr-002746
02:20:41.700 --> 02:20:42.660
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Meron kayong data nyan?

