03:59:52.420 --> 03:59:54.280
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: of the Senate about Action

asr-004862
03:59:54.280 --> 03:59:56.180
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Klima Pilipinas' specialized

asr-004863
03:59:56.180 --> 03:59:58.120
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: report that Senator Gachalian was mentioning

asr-004864
03:59:58.120 --> 03:59:59.980
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: earlier that he would like to request.

asr-004865
04:00:00.000 --> 04:00:02.380
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: from civil society representatives here.

asr-004866
04:00:02.940 --> 04:00:04.740
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: We have prepared in Action Klima Pilipinas

asr-004867
04:00:04.740 --> 04:00:07.400
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: a State of the Philippine Climate Budget Report

asr-004868
04:00:07.400 --> 04:00:12.860
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: that analyzes the entire national budget for 2026

asr-004869
04:00:12.860 --> 04:00:14.840
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: on the perspective of climate action.

asr-004870
04:00:15.140 --> 04:00:16.080
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: But we'll get to that later.

asr-004871
04:00:16.380 --> 04:00:17.120
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Next slide, please.

asr-004872
04:00:17.580 --> 04:00:20.200
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So, the People's Budget Coalition already mentioned this earlier,

asr-004873
04:00:20.400 --> 04:00:21.900
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: so I'm just going to get straight to the point here.

asr-004874
04:00:22.420 --> 04:00:25.720
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: What I would like to show here instead is a needs-based visualization

asr-004875
04:00:25.720 --> 04:00:30.500
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: of one of the DPWH infrastructure project types

asr-004876
04:00:30.500 --> 04:00:34.520
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: compared to the drought projections of Pag-Asa itself

asr-004877
04:00:34.520 --> 04:00:36.660
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: that they shared a couple of weeks ago only.

asr-004878
04:00:36.820 --> 04:00:39.180
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: This is the October latest version of Pag-Asa's drought.

asr-004879
04:00:39.660 --> 04:00:42.500
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Kitang-kita naman po, mas kulay blue,

asr-004880
04:00:42.880 --> 04:00:44.500
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: mas mataas ang budget allocation.

asr-004881
04:00:44.920 --> 04:00:46.760
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Ito po ay galing sa HGAB.

asr-004882
04:00:47.400 --> 04:00:50.460
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Mas red, mas malakas ang chance ang magkakadroughts.

asr-004883
04:00:50.780 --> 04:00:53.400
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: By March 2027, wala po tayong takas.

asr-004884
04:00:53.680 --> 04:00:55.700
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Every single province will be,

asr-004885
04:00:55.720 --> 04:00:57.060
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: suffering droughts.

asr-004886
04:00:57.720 --> 04:00:59.500
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Pinapakita po natin yung October 2026

asr-004887
04:00:59.500 --> 04:01:01.980
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: kahit di po talaga siya sakot palagan ng 2027 budget

asr-004888
04:01:01.980 --> 04:01:05.360
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: dahil ito pong mga pabinsya na ito na ating minakahan sa bilog,

asr-004889
04:01:05.720 --> 04:01:07.340
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: ito po ang mga unang tatamaan ng droughts.

asr-004890
04:01:07.420 --> 04:01:09.040
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: At tinatamaan na po sila ng droughts.

asr-004891
04:01:09.280 --> 04:01:10.960
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Bicol, Eastern Visayas.

asr-004892
04:01:11.600 --> 04:01:14.640
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Sila po ba ang dapat makuha ng budget,

asr-004893
04:01:15.240 --> 04:01:17.740
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: prioritization-wise, sa water infrastructure?

asr-004894
04:01:18.100 --> 04:01:19.200
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Ipa pa pong irrigation dito.

asr-004895
04:01:19.340 --> 04:01:21.480
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: This is just water infrastructure projects of DPWH.

asr-004896
04:01:21.480 --> 04:01:25.440
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Rainwater harvesting and solar water pumps, among others.

asr-004897
04:01:25.720 --> 04:01:27.720
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Pero kung tina po natin yung January 2027,

asr-004898
04:01:27.720 --> 04:01:32.480
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Western Visayas, Mindoro, sila rin po ang ilang unang tatamaan ng droughts.

asr-004899
04:01:32.480 --> 04:01:36.840
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: But are they getting the biggest cut of the water infrastructure project of DPWH?

asr-004900
04:01:37.380 --> 04:01:37.720
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: No.

asr-004901
04:01:38.380 --> 04:01:42.000
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So, this is another example of the needs-based assessment

asr-004902
04:01:42.000 --> 04:01:44.880
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: na kailangan gawin sa lahat ng proyekta ng gobyerno.

asr-004903
04:01:45.200 --> 04:01:49.100
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Ito po ay nasa Section 40 ng GAAM mismo ng 2026

asr-004904
04:01:49.100 --> 04:01:50.220
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: and it's even in the NEP.

asr-004905
04:01:50.220 --> 04:01:54.600
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: All government projects, multi-probabilistic assessment.

asr-004906
04:01:54.600 --> 04:01:57.440
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Dapat may ganun po, needs-based.

asr-004907
04:01:57.760 --> 04:01:59.220
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Nasa GAAM po yan at nasa NEP.

asr-004908
04:01:59.900 --> 04:02:02.780
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So, ito sa ipotong halimbawa ng needs-based assessment na kailangan gawin.

asr-004909
04:02:03.080 --> 04:02:03.760
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Next slide, please.

asr-004910
04:02:05.360 --> 04:02:10.400
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Here's another interesting thing that I'm honestly surprised has not been mentioned as much so far.

asr-004911
04:02:10.840 --> 04:02:12.180
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Let's talk about nature-based solutions.

asr-004912
04:02:12.640 --> 04:02:16.820
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: One of the newest buzzwords when it comes to the climate and environment sector in this country.

asr-004913
04:02:17.720 --> 04:02:19.800
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Alam naman po natin na kulang na kulang po sa pondo.

asr-004914
04:02:20.520 --> 04:02:22.440
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So, what I would try to do instead is give you numbers.

asr-004915
04:02:23.700 --> 04:02:24.520
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Last year,

asr-004916
04:02:24.600 --> 04:02:28.840
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: wala pa pong kongkretong estimate ng nature-based solutions funding sa Pilipinas.

asr-004917
04:02:29.560 --> 04:02:31.740
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So, the closest for us in action climate that we got

asr-004918
04:02:31.740 --> 04:02:35.560
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: is NCCAP or National Climate Change Action Plan Goal No. 3

asr-004919
04:02:35.560 --> 04:02:38.840
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: which corresponds to ecological and environmental stability.

asr-004920
04:02:39.260 --> 04:02:42.820
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: All environmental projects are under Goal 3 of NCCAP.

asr-004921
04:02:43.740 --> 04:02:46.120
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: It's only 0.12% of this year's GAAM.

asr-004922
04:02:46.980 --> 04:02:52.760
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Ang ASEAN public expenditures percentage for nature-based solutions, 0.64%.

asr-004923
04:02:52.760 --> 04:02:53.680
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: If we do the math,

asr-004924
04:02:53.680 --> 04:02:55.160
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: ibig sabihin po niyan,

asr-004925
04:02:55.920 --> 04:02:58.320
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: 8 billion for 2026 GAAM ang nature-based solutions,

asr-004926
04:02:58.480 --> 04:02:59.440
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: well, scale-wise,

asr-004927
04:02:59.880 --> 04:03:01.120
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: kasi wala pa pong kongkretong estimate,

asr-004928
04:03:01.380 --> 04:03:04.980
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: pero ang ASEAN public expenditures for nature-based solutions,

asr-004929
04:03:05.560 --> 04:03:07.700
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: 43 billion ang katumbas niya sa GAAM.

asr-004930
04:03:08.200 --> 04:03:09.740
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: And if we apply it to this year's NEP,

asr-004931
04:03:10.220 --> 04:03:11.120
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: 7.2 billion,

asr-004932
04:03:11.480 --> 04:03:13.240
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: that would be 46 billion.

asr-004933
04:03:13.840 --> 04:03:17.560
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Sinabi po ni Yusek Anate na ang kasunod ko yung budget po ng DNR,

asr-004934
04:03:18.260 --> 04:03:20.300
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: 1.7 billion lamang.

asr-004935
04:03:20.720 --> 04:03:22.720
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: That's a lot of money still,

asr-004936
04:03:22.720 --> 04:03:23.640
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: but that's not enough.

asr-004937
04:03:24.220 --> 04:03:25.440
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: And that's just DNR.

asr-004938
04:03:25.560 --> 04:03:28.640
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Pero yung scale po nung 0.12% versus 0.64%,

asr-004939
04:03:29.340 --> 04:03:31.780
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: 1.7 billion versus 46 billion,

asr-004940
04:03:32.180 --> 04:03:33.760
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: simply not enough.

asr-004941
04:03:36.460 --> 04:03:40.880
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Kung kaya po ng camera na magmanipulan ng daang-daang bilyong piso para sa infra-projects,

asr-004942
04:03:40.980 --> 04:03:44.380
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: what is stopping anyone from allotting more to nature-based solutions?

asr-004943
04:03:45.760 --> 04:03:46.440
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Next slide, please.

asr-004944
04:03:47.480 --> 04:03:49.100
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: And that's why to our esteemed senators,

asr-004945
04:03:49.220 --> 04:03:50.560
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: we'd like to forward the following recommendations.

asr-004946
04:03:50.560 --> 04:03:53.560
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: To further super El Nino-proof our nationalization,

asr-004947
04:03:53.680 --> 04:03:54.840
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: our national budget for next year.

asr-004948
04:03:55.260 --> 04:04:00.240
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Ilan po dito ay nabanggit na po nila Sen. Gatchelyan at Sen. Ejercito in the last couple of days.

asr-004949
04:04:00.340 --> 04:04:01.300
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So we're just reiterating.

asr-004950
04:04:02.060 --> 04:04:04.740
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: PCIC, bakit babawasan ang cap insurance?

asr-004951
04:04:05.040 --> 04:04:05.940
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: It doesn't make any sense.

asr-004952
04:04:06.180 --> 04:04:07.460
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Bakit babawasan ang NRIMPA?

asr-004953
04:04:07.540 --> 04:04:10.380
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Nabanggit na po yan kanina ng Code NGO.

asr-004954
04:04:10.560 --> 04:04:11.780
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So we're not going to go much into that.

asr-004955
04:04:12.500 --> 04:04:13.040
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: You should not.

asr-004956
04:04:13.680 --> 04:04:17.060
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Ang kailangan po nating makita ay ang Super El Nino National Action Plan.

asr-004957
04:04:17.060 --> 04:04:21.100
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: That is what should be the basis for a needs-based assessment.

asr-004958
04:04:23.020 --> 04:04:23.560
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: PSF.

asr-004959
04:04:23.680 --> 04:04:30.120
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: I think may opportunity po tayo na i-examine ang disbursement ng PSF.

asr-004960
04:04:30.240 --> 04:04:34.900
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Makakatulong po ang PSF sa adaptation lalapos Super El Nino.

asr-004961
04:04:35.500 --> 04:04:38.160
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: And our proposal for nature-based solutions,

asr-004962
04:04:39.060 --> 04:04:40.960
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: 1.7 billion for DNR right now in the NEP.

asr-004963
04:04:42.140 --> 04:04:43.520
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Why not 1 billion per region?

asr-004964
04:04:44.240 --> 04:04:45.600
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Transboundary nature-based solutions.

asr-004965
04:04:46.160 --> 04:04:47.160
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: More communities will benefit.

asr-004966
04:04:47.500 --> 04:04:49.580
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: We invest in nature-based solutions.

asr-004967
04:04:49.580 --> 04:04:51.380
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: We invest in our future.

asr-004968
04:04:52.200 --> 04:04:53.660
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: And that's why for our final slide,

asr-004969
04:04:53.680 --> 04:04:55.800
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: as promised,

asr-004970
04:04:56.340 --> 04:04:58.880
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: we would like to share to our esteemed senators

asr-004971
04:04:58.880 --> 04:05:02.160
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: and to everyone and to the dozens watching on Facebook Live

asr-004972
04:05:02.160 --> 04:05:05.940
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: our two Philippine Climate Budget Reports.

asr-004973
04:05:06.020 --> 04:05:07.640
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: We actually did a report last year po,

asr-004974
04:05:07.700 --> 04:05:10.600
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: which examines 2020 to 2025.

asr-004975
04:05:11.300 --> 04:05:12.320
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: But moving forward,

asr-004976
04:05:12.420 --> 04:05:14.660
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: we will start an annual examination

asr-004977
04:05:14.660 --> 04:05:16.960
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: of the climate tagging system in the Philippines.

asr-004978
04:05:17.480 --> 04:05:18.000
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: For the record,

asr-004979
04:05:18.160 --> 04:05:19.680
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: ang in-charge po sa climate tagging,

asr-004980
04:05:19.760 --> 04:05:20.400
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: yung CCET,

asr-004981
04:05:20.840 --> 04:05:22.100
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: CCC po yan at DBM.

asr-004982
04:05:22.200 --> 04:05:23.660
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: But ang nagtatagpo ng program,

asr-004983
04:05:23.720 --> 04:05:24.080
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: projects,

asr-004984
04:05:24.200 --> 04:05:25.460
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: ay hindi CCC at DBM lang.

asr-004985
04:05:25.820 --> 04:05:27.900
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Every agency tags their own projects.

asr-004986
04:05:28.240 --> 04:05:29.780
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: So we'd just like to share these reports.

asr-004987
04:05:30.080 --> 04:05:30.740
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Make your record po.

asr-004988
04:05:30.920 --> 04:05:33.180
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: And we have shared copies online,

asr-004989
04:05:33.420 --> 04:05:34.280
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: also to the committee,

asr-004990
04:05:34.740 --> 04:05:35.620
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: for your reference,

asr-004991
04:05:35.720 --> 04:05:38.000
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: and to everyone here who attended on-site.

asr-004992
04:05:38.320 --> 04:05:39.000
Aksyon Klima Pilipinas National Coordinator John Leo Algo: Maraming salamat po.

asr-004993
04:05:40.500 --> 04:05:41.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you.

asr-004994
04:05:41.320 --> 04:05:42.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maraming salamat.

asr-004995
04:05:43.520 --> 04:05:44.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. John Algo,

asr-004996
04:05:45.020 --> 04:05:45.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: actually,

asr-004997
04:05:46.080 --> 04:05:46.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung ano,

asr-004998
04:05:46.580 --> 04:05:49.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung during the DPWH and NIA,

asr-004999
04:05:49.260 --> 04:05:50.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: budget hearings,

asr-005000
04:05:50.860 --> 04:05:51.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I told,

asr-005001
04:05:51.600 --> 04:05:53.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we recommended,

asr-005002
04:05:53.300 --> 04:05:53.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: no?

asr-005003
04:05:53.520 --> 04:05:53.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That,

asr-005004
04:05:53.680 --> 04:05:59.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: instead na mag-focus sila sa flood control projects,

asr-005005
04:05:59.540 --> 04:06:01.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang DPWH and NIA,

asr-005006
04:06:01.320 --> 04:06:03.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: doon sa irrigation lamang,

asr-005007
04:06:04.180 --> 04:06:06.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we should already look at the long term,

asr-005008
04:06:06.420 --> 04:06:06.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: diba?

asr-005009
04:06:07.540 --> 04:06:09.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dapat water retention,

asr-005010
04:06:09.720 --> 04:06:10.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: impounding,

asr-005011
04:06:11.420 --> 04:06:13.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: because we have so much water every rainy season,

asr-005012
04:06:13.920 --> 04:06:15.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and pag dry season,

