asr-005438
04:15:11.200 --> 04:15:18.140
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Ito pong 75 million, ang mapapondohan lang po nito ay malamang po ay janitorial and security personnel.

asr-005439
04:15:18.340 --> 04:15:24.840
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Wala pong pondo na mailalabas para sa C5 busway, Ortigas Avenue busway at sa Quezon Avenue busway.

asr-005440
04:15:24.840 --> 04:15:38.040
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Ganon din po ang nangyari sa Cebu BRT, 4% lang din po ng original DOTR proposal ang napondohan at ito po ay makakaapekto sa sobrang dami pong commuters na nasa Cebu.

asr-005441
04:15:38.420 --> 04:15:44.260
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Si Sen. JV kakagaling lang din po sa Cebu checking on the health facility so I'm sure he knows about this then.

asr-005442
04:15:45.300 --> 04:15:51.840
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Ito po, ang nag-trending ngayon at nagvaviral for good reason ang experience po ng mga commuters sa LRT2.

asr-005443
04:15:52.860 --> 04:15:54.840
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Meron pong pinropose ang DOTR.

asr-005444
04:15:54.840 --> 04:16:00.980
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: 12.8 billion to purchase additional trainsets for the LRT2.

asr-005445
04:16:01.200 --> 04:16:03.780
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Ang lumabas po sa NEP ay zero.

asr-005446
04:16:04.500 --> 04:16:17.920
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: So ngayon po meron po tayong 10 na operational, dalawa po nire-repair ngayon so 8 lang po talaga na trainsets ang nagra-run po from recto all the way to antipolo.

asr-005447
04:16:18.140 --> 04:16:19.540
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: So sa LRT2 po natin.

asr-005448
04:16:20.620 --> 04:16:24.540
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: 8 of the 18 original trainsets are already beyond repair.

asr-005449
04:16:24.840 --> 04:16:34.760
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: So from the 18 original, ngayon po 10 na lang, dalawa po doon sa 10 na yun ay again inaayos po so 8 lang po ang running ngayon.

asr-005450
04:16:34.880 --> 04:16:44.540
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: So imagine po, nagiging more than 10 minutes na headway pero even if 10 minutes yung frequency nung trains, hindi pa po sigurado kung makakapasok ka.

asr-005451
04:16:45.340 --> 04:16:53.180
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Ang sinabi po nga nila, yung Betty Govel Monte Station na dati po ay wala masyadong tao, ang haba na po ng pila ngayon.

asr-005452
04:16:53.180 --> 04:16:54.600
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: So yun po yung for us.

asr-005453
04:16:54.840 --> 04:16:59.520
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Big sign na medyo palala ng palala na po ang sitwasyon for LRT2.

asr-005454
04:17:00.500 --> 04:17:02.300
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Next slide po.

asr-005455
04:17:02.620 --> 04:17:05.200
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Continuing po sa rail projects.

asr-005456
