Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Yun po yung sa previous slide po.

asr-005457
04:17:08.140 --> 04:17:08.400
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Wait lang.

asr-005458
04:17:08.780 --> 04:17:09.340
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Ano po yung nasa?

asr-005459
04:17:10.420 --> 04:17:11.900
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Ayan, yung next slide na po siguro.

asr-005460
04:17:12.760 --> 04:17:13.300
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Ayan, thank you.

asr-005461
04:17:13.940 --> 04:17:24.260
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: For the NSCR, Metro Manila Subway, ito po yung nabanggit na ito po yung pinaka nakaranas po ng pinaka mataas na cuts among all department foreign assisted projects.

asr-005462
04:17:24.840 --> 04:17:31.120
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Yung 19 billion po ang nabawas for the Metro Manila Subway and 15 billion ang nabawas for the NSCR.

asr-005463
04:17:31.120 --> 04:17:41.520
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Alam po natin ilang billions na ang nababayad because we have been delaying these projects in interest payments, in commitment fees tama po.

asr-005464
04:17:42.120 --> 04:17:49.920
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: So ito po yung sana makorect ng Senate dahil ito po yung kinot ng House after they passed the budget.

asr-005465
04:17:50.100 --> 04:17:54.540
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: This will delay the NSCR and the Metro Manila Subway back.

asr-005466
04:17:54.540 --> 04:17:56.580
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Many years because of this.

asr-005467
04:17:57.480 --> 04:18:06.600
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Next po, tinatawag ko po ang aming road safety advocate na si Lou Hepuela to share a bit on road safety, and then mamaya po si Doc Mau.

asr-005468
04:18:06.860 --> 04:18:07.360
Move As One Coalition Representative Ysabel Eugene G. Agregado: Thank you po.

asr-005469
04:18:13.160 --> 04:18:13.840
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Thank you.

asr-005470
04:18:15.040 --> 04:18:17.040
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Hello po, Mr. Chairman, Senators.

asr-005471
04:18:17.280 --> 04:18:17.940
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Magandang hapon po.

asr-005472
04:18:18.060 --> 04:18:21.480
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Ako po si Lou Hepuela, road safety advocate for Move Us One Coalition.

asr-005473
04:18:22.320 --> 04:18:24.480
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Every third Sunday po noong November.

asr-005474
04:18:24.540 --> 04:18:31.920
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Bate po sa RA 11468, mayroon po tayong National Day of Remembrance for road crash victims, survivors, and their families.

asr-005475
04:18:32.760 --> 04:18:37.080
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Ngayon, ang tanong po, sino po ang in-charge sa road safety sa Pilipinas?

asr-005476
04:18:37.860 --> 04:18:48.140
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Per administrative order po ni PGMA, dahil binuwag po niya yung National Road Safety Committee, which was a cabinet-level committee meeting every so often on road safety,

asr-005477
04:18:49.080 --> 04:18:53.220
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: ang nangyayari po ngayon ay si DOTR ang may responsibility sa road safety.

asr-005478
04:18:53.720 --> 04:18:54.520
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Ngayon, last.

asr-005479
04:18:54.520 --> 04:19:02.580
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Last year po, 2025, May, road safety month, tinalaga po ni then-Secretary Vince Dizon ang Task Force Road Safety.

asr-005480
04:19:03.780 --> 04:19:16.580
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Ngayon, naulit na po, since he's now Transportation Secretary, yung problema na po dito, ang mga naka-assign na tao for Task Force Road Safety, busy rin po sila sa Public Transport Modernization Program.

asr-005481
04:19:17.560 --> 04:19:21.240
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Yung problema po dito, hindi po pwede part-time nagtatrabaho sa road safety.

asr-005482
04:19:21.240 --> 04:19:24.240
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Which is why, and DOTR,

asr-005483
04:19:24.520 --> 04:19:31.320
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: marvellous document called the PRSAP, the Philippine Road Safety Action Plan, 2023 to 2028, eh 2026 na po.

asr-005484
04:19:32.200 --> 04:19:39.180
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Galaw pagong po ang action sa action plan na yan, kasi wala pong funding for road safety for the past three years.

asr-005485
04:19:39.660 --> 04:19:50.260
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: Which is why we ask the Senate, please, kung seryoso po talaga tayo in helping in preventing road crashes, in making sure that our most vulnerable are protected,

asr-005486
04:19:50.260 --> 04:19:52.740
Move As One Coalition Road Safety Advocate Lou Hepuela: please, please fund road safety. Thank you po.

asr-005487
04:19:54.520 --> 04:19:59.300
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: May atas ko naman po, sorry, for MOVA's one po, the Accessibility and Inclusion.

asr-005488
04:19:59.740 --> 04:20:02.080
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Hello po, Sen. JV, Sen. Ping, and Sen. Win.

asr-005489
04:20:02.880 --> 04:20:06.320
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Iko-connect ko lang po sa nabanggit ni Jibel at sa kanilo.

asr-005490
04:20:08.060 --> 04:20:16.760
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Pag hindi po accessible ang ating kalsada, ang ating sasakyan, ang ating infrastructure, definitely road crashes happen.

asr-005491
04:20:16.760 --> 04:20:24.400
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Isa po sa datos natin na nagkakaroon ng physical disability ang mga tao ay dahil po sa road.

asr-005492
04:20:24.400 --> 04:20:28.440
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: So, dagdag na naman po ito sa datos ng tao may kapansanan.

asr-005493
04:20:28.860 --> 04:20:38.400
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: At nabanggit po ni Dr. Elisa kanina na in our entire life cycle mula bata hanggang tayo ay nakatatanda, tayo po ay makaka-experience ng kapansanan.

asr-005494
04:20:39.160 --> 04:20:47.760
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Lalong-lalo na kung tayo po ay nakaka-experience or interact ng different barriers na nakikita po natin like for example, Mount Kamuning.

asr-005495
04:20:47.760 --> 04:20:54.380
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Siguro simulan lang, dagdagan ko rin lang na mobility and connectivity is very important.

asr-005496
04:20:54.400 --> 04:21:02.340
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Nabanggit po ng lahat dito, accessible, having an accessible health services, accessible education, lahat po accessible.

asr-005497
04:21:02.780 --> 04:21:05.660
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Pero gaano ba ka-accessible ito kung may mga naiiwan?

asr-005498
04:21:06.100 --> 04:21:11.300
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Lalo na sa 12.9 million persons with disabilities na hindi lamang po sa Imperial Manila manggagaling.

asr-005499
04:21:11.720 --> 04:21:15.600
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Manggagaling po ito sa 18 regions natin sa buong Pilipinas.

asr-005500
04:21:15.600 --> 04:21:23.000
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Saka sa pinupuntahan po namin, isla pa po ito, ultimo ambulansya na pag may sakit po yung tao may kapansanan,

asr-005501
04:21:23.340 --> 04:21:24.080
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: bangka po.

asr-005502
04:21:24.400 --> 04:21:25.400
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Ang kanilang sasakayan.

asr-005503
04:21:25.940 --> 04:21:27.200
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: So, tignan po natin, no?

asr-005504
04:21:28.120 --> 04:21:30.280
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: First and last mile, gaano po ba?

asr-005505
04:21:30.860 --> 04:21:34.040
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Kasi sobrang insufficient ang public transport natin.

asr-005506
04:21:34.200 --> 04:21:38.060
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Hindi naman po kaya ng lahat na sumakay ng grab ng NETNVS.

asr-005507
04:21:38.160 --> 04:21:41.760
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Ako po, pag hindi kaya ng pamasahay ko, nagmumoto-taxi po ako.

asr-005508
04:21:41.820 --> 04:21:49.340
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Pero my safety is very, very araw-araw po na ang aking puso po ay kumakabog kasi hindi ko po alam baka mamatay ako.

asr-005509
04:21:49.880 --> 04:21:51.720
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Dahil sa pagmumoto-taxi.

asr-005510
04:21:52.240 --> 04:21:54.380
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: So, ang accessibility.

asr-005511
04:21:54.400 --> 04:21:56.740
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Accessibility po ay precondition to inclusion.

asr-005512
04:21:57.420 --> 04:22:03.560
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Kami po ay nade-discriminate, hindi po makakapag-participate on an equal basis with others kung walang aksesibilidad.

asr-005513
04:22:04.380 --> 04:22:08.400
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Aksesibilidad, sabi nga po ni Dr. Elisa, ulitin ko lang, it's a universal design.

asr-005514
04:22:09.480 --> 04:22:14.480
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Pag-accessible po, ang kalsada, ang pedestrian, ang sidewalk, no?

asr-005515
04:22:14.900 --> 04:22:21.860
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Paglabas pa lang po ng bahay, lahat po, hindi lang po persons with disabilities ang makaka-access nito,

asr-005516
04:22:21.860 --> 04:22:24.360
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: kundi po buong tao sa ating pamayan.

asr-005517
04:22:24.400 --> 04:22:31.820
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: So, ang nire-request po namin sana para ang health services po ay maging accessible, hindi lamang po ito physical,

asr-005518
04:22:32.120 --> 04:22:40.060
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: hindi lamang po ito kailangan may sign language interpreter, hindi lamang po may captioner, hindi lamang po ito dapat may audio description.

asr-005519
04:22:40.560 --> 04:22:47.380
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Siguraduhin din po natin ang digital accessibility is set in place for persons of different types of disabilities

asr-005520
04:22:47.380 --> 04:22:50.740
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: para sigurado natin hindi po talaga din sila mapag-iiwanan.

asr-005521
04:22:50.740 --> 04:22:54.220
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: So, budget po for safety, napakahalaga.

asr-005522
04:22:54.400 --> 04:23:01.940
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: At para po hindi na madagdagan yung pansanan, para hindi na po matularan na merong mount kamuning at grade crosswalks po,

asr-005523
04:23:02.420 --> 04:23:05.080
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: yan po yung nilalabitin namin sa Move As One Coalition.

asr-005524
04:23:05.600 --> 04:23:15.120
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: At siguraduhin po na may protected bike lanes po tayo para sa ating mga nagbibisikleta ay hindi po araw-araw buwis buhay ang kanilang na-experience.

asr-005525
04:23:15.120 --> 04:23:22.300
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: So, ang pedestrians and commuters po ay nasa top po ng hierarchy ng national transport policy.

asr-005526
04:23:22.920 --> 04:23:24.220
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: So, para po ma-access.

asr-005527
04:23:24.400 --> 04:23:32.000
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Mga binabanggit po ng ating mga kasama dito ng mga CSOs, napakahalaga po na ang accessibility po ay should be put in place.

asr-005528
04:23:32.120 --> 04:23:32.880
Move As One Coalition Co-convener Dr. Maureen Mata: Maraming salamat po.

asr-005529
04:23:34.880 --> 04:23:35.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you.

asr-005530
04:23:35.520 --> 04:23:39.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Are you done?

asr-005531
04:23:40.420 --> 04:23:41.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mayroon sa show, no?

asr-005532
04:23:41.780 --> 04:23:47.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Alam niyo na ma-advoc kasi ko yung transport modernization because I believe that this will stimulate economic growth,

asr-005533
04:23:47.600 --> 04:23:48.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: talaga yung mga railway.

