Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung hospital bills daw, hindi bumababa ng six digits.

asr-006222
04:58:45.840 --> 04:58:48.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So siguro, Dr. Albert Ong, quickly, that's it.

asr-006223
