asr-007061
05:17:35.280 --> 05:17:37.760
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Because there are three major funds under the LGSF.

asr-007062
05:17:38.120 --> 05:17:40.200
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Under the HGAB, around 62 billion na siya.

asr-007063
05:17:40.680 --> 05:17:42.640
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Meron pong financial assistance to LGUs.

asr-007064
05:17:42.740 --> 05:17:45.660
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Actually, yun po yung pinag-uusapan natin kanina, 41.5 billion.

asr-007065
05:17:46.220 --> 05:17:49.240
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: There's also a second category called the growth equity fund.

asr-007066
05:17:49.240 --> 05:17:50.560
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Around 10.3 billion.

asr-007067
05:17:50.600 --> 05:17:53.840
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: This is supposed to change the inequitable allocations

asr-007068
05:17:53.840 --> 05:17:56.000
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: by the national tax allotment.

asr-007069
05:17:56.340 --> 05:17:59.100
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Although we know that at the longer term,

asr-007070
05:17:59.200 --> 05:18:02.420
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: yung kailangan po talaga natin ay a change in the way that NTA is computed.

asr-007071
05:18:02.620 --> 05:18:06.200
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Which I think there are pending bills also pushed by Local Gov PH,

asr-007072
05:18:06.300 --> 05:18:07.960
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: one of our coalition members.

asr-007073
05:18:08.160 --> 05:18:12.540
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: And then, third po, si NTF-ELCAC support to barangay is 9.7 billion.

asr-007074
05:18:12.720 --> 05:18:17.120
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Which we're all saying we should abolish it and just remove the funding for that.

asr-007075
05:18:17.480 --> 05:18:20.240
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: So that we can increase funding for

asr-007076
05:18:20.240 --> 05:18:25.620
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: for the improvement in the equity in the changes.

asr-007077
05:18:26.000 --> 05:18:28.620
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: So ngayon naman po, sa financial assistance to LGUs in particular,

asr-007078
05:18:29.260 --> 05:18:34.360
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: yung iba pong mga iniisip namin na designs include a matching fund.

asr-007079
05:18:34.700 --> 05:18:36.860
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Yung matching fund ng LGUs.

asr-007080
05:18:36.980 --> 05:18:43.020
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Kasi for example, dapat po merong nationally mandated programs

asr-007081
05:18:43.020 --> 05:18:47.400
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: such as for example, malnutrition programs na pwedeng nakailangan,

asr-007082
05:18:47.400 --> 05:18:49.260
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: na priorities talaga for early childhood.

asr-007083
05:18:50.240 --> 05:18:54.560
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: At 1,000 days, the local government units will only get the fund

asr-007084
05:18:54.560 --> 05:18:59.360
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: if they provide counterpart funding para doble yung financial assistance.

asr-007085
05:18:59.440 --> 05:19:03.460
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: We can also do the same for mobility, for local transport and mobility offices.

asr-007086
05:19:03.460 --> 05:19:08.980
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: So maybe we can think of a special provision and we can design something together as NJV

asr-007087
05:19:08.980 --> 05:19:13.720
